<title>NETHERLANDS: Wesselius raises IHC Caland to Buy.</title>
<headline>Wesselius raises IHC Caland to Buy.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Jan 17 research.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector------------Price---Broker----------</p>
<p>IHC Caland   Dredging equipment  105.20  Wesselius</p>
<p>COMMENT: Raise to a Buy.</p>
<p>IHC may be in line to use its dredging expertise in Dutch tunnel drilling projects. It also leases FPSOs to dollar-based oil firms. Lease profits should rise as dollar firms versus the guilder. Both developments should contribute to IHC profits.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	pvs	P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1996		   3.68	-	  -	   -</p>
<p>    1997		   4.21	-	25.3	  -</p>
<p>    1998		   4.82	-	22.0	  -</p>
